    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "プロンプト本文",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "OTEL_LOG_USER_PROMPTS=1 で収集した user_prompt 本文（全文・折返し表示）。振り返り時に「何を・どんな前提で頼んだか」をここで思い出す。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 28,
        "w": 9,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{event_name=\"user_prompt\"} | prompt_id=\"$prompt_id\" | label_format body=`{{ printf \"\\n%s\\n \" .prompt }}`",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          }
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "extractFields",
          "options": {
            "source": "labels",
            "format": "json",
            "replace": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "filterFieldsByName",
          "options": {
            "include": {
              "pattern": "^(body)$"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": {
            "cellOptions": {
              "type": "auto",
              "wrapText": true
            },
            "filterable": false
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "cellHeight": "md",
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        },
        "showHeader": false
      },
      "id": 7
    },
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "セッション内の位置（context遷移と前後のプロンプト）",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "description": "このセッションの context_tokens 遷移の中で、この依頼（赤点）がどの位置だったか。縦線 = セッション内の各プロンプト送信（ホバーで本文冒頭）。読み方: 直前の縦線・点との時間の空きが大きい × 直後に線が急伸（cache_creation で作り直し）= 放置によるキャッシュ失効の再構築。プロンプト一覧の行リンク経由では、時間レンジが「プロンプト開始−90分 〜 終了+30分」に自動設定され、session_id も渡る（.* のままだと全セッションが重なる）。",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 15,
        "x": 9,
        "y": 6
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (sid) (max_over_time({event_name=\"api_request\"} | session_id=~\"$session_id\" | label_format sid=\"{{ substr 0 8 .session_id }}\" | unwrap context_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "context {{sid}}",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "queryType": "range"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "max by (mark) (max_over_time({event_name=\"api_request\"} | prompt_id=\"$prompt_id\" | label_format mark=\"この依頼\" | unwrap context_tokens [$__interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "この依頼",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "queryType": "range"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "pointSize": 4,
            "spanNulls": 900000,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "thresholdsStyle": {
              "mode": "line"
            }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "transparent",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 150000
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 200000
              }
            ]
          },
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "この依頼"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "red"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.drawStyle",
                "value": "points"
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.pointSize",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "id": "custom.lineWidth",
                "value": 0
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "id": 17
    },
    {
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "トークン種別内訳",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
